      "difficulty": "Easy",
      "prompt": "The equation of a circle with center $(h,k)$, radius $r$ is:\nA) $x^2+y^2=r$\nB) $(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=r^2$\nC) $(x+h)^2+(y+k)^2=r$\nD) $xh+yk=r^2$",
      "answer": "B) $(x-h)^2+(y-k)^2=r^2$",
